  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large pan over medium heat",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute",
    "Add the curry powder and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly",
    "Add the pineapple chunks, nuka-pickle, and coconut milk, and stir to combine",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 15 minutes",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste",
    "Serve hot over rice or noodles"
